    - target: {fileID: 2798451332107151014, guid: e0fb58b0ba6ba6d488f1fa635b2a1289, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The <color=#569CD6>hash function</color>  is used to <color=#569CD6>convert</color> 
        a <color=#569CD6>key to an index</color> to an index for the hash table.
        \n\nTry it by:\n1. typing a key in the keypad then press the green button.\n2. 
        Place the resulting paper to the printer.\n3. The output yellow paper will
        be the index.\n\nTo view the equivalent code for the hash function, press
        the red button in the printer."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
